```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Phase 1A: Discovery & Architecture (Weeks 1–4)                                    |
| - Process mapping, integration design between Routemaster & Salesforce/NetSuite   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
